abstract: "Turns a credited recent OpenAI ordinary-Curveball operator bound into an exact conditional error-budget planner, immutable Graph snapshots and explicit batch allowance. Includes reproducible descriptive evidence and separately scoped bounded proof/certificate tools. Package version 0.5.0; current-main source additions are distinct from frozen release artifacts. No new sampler, empirical superiority or whole-fast-stack verification is established."
